    "DIŞ İLİŞKİLER\nÇukurova Üniversitesi\nKalite Politikaları\nÇukurova Üniversitesi\nAnasayfa\nArşiv (Eski Site)\nArama\nEnglish\ntoggle_navigation\nÇUKUROVA ÜNİVERSİTESİ\nDIŞ İLİŞKİLER\nGENEL BİLGİ\nDış İlişkiler Birimi\nOrganizasyon\nAkademik Kurul\nDış İlişkiler Ekibi\nAkademik Takvim\nBirim Faaliyet Raporları\nErasmus Policy Statement of Cukurova University\nKurumsal Politikalar\nİçerme ve Çeşitlilik\nİç Kontrol\nDEĞİŞİM PROGRAMLARI\nERASMUS\nMEVLANA\nFARABİ\nPROTOKOL KAPSAMINDA DEĞİŞİM\nULUSLARARASI İŞBİRLİKLERİ\nUluslararasılaşma Stratejisi\nİkili İşbirliği Protokolleri\nMoU Ortakları\nOrtak Programlar\nDoktora Eş Danışmanlık\nMİSAFİR ARAŞTIRMACI\nYönerge\nBaşvuru\nDokümanlar ve Formlar\nMisafirlerimiz\nULUSLARARASI AĞLAR\nDEĞİŞİM PROGRAMLARI\nPROTOKOL KAPSAMINDA DEĞİŞİM\nGelen Öğrenci\nPROTOKOL KAPSAMINDA DEĞİŞİM\nGiden Öğrenci\nGelen Öğrenci\nÖğrenci Deneyimleri\nGelen Öğrenci\nEligibility Criteria for Incoming Students\nUndergraduate, post-graduate and doctoral students studying at partner universities are eligible for application.\nStudents are required to have at least B2 level of Foreign Language Proficiency in the language of the program at which they wish to study at Cukurova University.\nApplication\nTo apply for an exchange study period at Çukurova University, you need to be nominated officially by your International Office. The applications received will be sent to the relevant program’s departmental boards for approval. Upon approval of the department, you will receive an email with practical information.\nApplication Documents\nApplication Form\nLearning Protocol\nUp-to-date Academic History / Academic Transcripts\nPhotocopy of passport showing your photo, number and expiration date (PDF).\nOfficial certification of English Language Proficiency (can be from your home university) (PDF).\nPhotocopy of health insurance proof in English.\nProof of current home university enrolment (PDF)\nA photo (in JPG format)\nFor ECTS Information Package / Course Catalogue, please\nclick\n.\nApplication Deadline:\nFall Semester:\nuntil 30th June\nSpring Semester:\nuntil 31st December"
